Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem is his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I'd love to nail that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He only has him every other weekend, and he still manages to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid comes home without food or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He hits him sometimes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say no if you went over and gave him a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's easy to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He always walks around in one of those ugly vests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He mostly hangs around the station in Uptown.
